    {
      "v": 9,
      "zh": "（从前以色列中，若有人去问　神，就说：「我们问先见去吧！」现在称为「先知」的，从前称为「先见」。）",
      "en": "(Now it used to be in Israel that whenever someone went to inquire of God he would say, “Come on, let’s go to the seer.” For today’s prophet used to be called a seer.)",
      "notes": [],
